#: code:addons/planning/models/ir_actions_report.py:0
msgid ""
"The Planning report cannot be printed from here. Please use the Print action "
"available in the Planning calendar and Gantt views."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດພິມບົດລາຍງານການວາງແຜນຈາກບ່ອນນີ້ໄດ້. ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງພິມທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນປະຕິທິນການວາງແຜນ ແລະ ມຸມມອ"
"ງ Gantt."

#. module: planning
